  "notable_quotes": [
    "MOF 1 undergoes reversible single-crystal-to-single-crystal breathing upon desolvation/resolvation, with responsive luminescence and visible color change.",
    "TGA/PXRD show channel H2O is completely removed above 120 °C, while the host framework decomposes only above 350 °C.",
    "The framework has about 35% free volume after guest removal, and channel water is hydrogen-bonded to –COO− and –NH2 groups, helping stabilize the structure."
  ],
